# Citation metadata for this repository. GitHub shows a "Cite this repository"
# button from this file (it must sit in the repository root), and Zenodo reads
# it when a release is archived. Before each release, update `version` and
# `date-released` to match the new tag.

cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "An ensemble of open binary CALPHAD assessments quantifies the uncertainty of the Nd2Fe14B feasibility threshold and surfaces inconsistencies invisible to single-assessment users"
abstract: >
    Code, per-combination results and diagnostic scripts for an ensemble of
    84 combinations of open binary CALPHAD assessments (3 Fe-Nd x 7 Fe-B x
    4 Nd-B) of the Nd-Fe-B system. Seventy-eight combinations pass a strict
    merge-then-edge-check protocol; for these the feasibility threshold of
    Nd2Fe14B is computed at eight temperatures between 800 and 1600 K and
    compared with two full ternary assessments.
authors:
